# Thespian's Stage becomes a copy of a Mutavault that is a 2/2 creature until end of turn. Only the Mutavault's printed values
# are copiable; its "becomes a creature" effect is not a copy effect (CR 707.2; the ruling: "if you copy a land that is also a
# creature because of a temporary effect ..., Thespian's Stage will become just the 'unanimated' land"). The Stage is a Land
# named Mutavault and no creature; the real Mutavault stays a 2/2 Land Creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Thespian's Stage
Sol Ring
Mutavault
Forest x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x15

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Thespian's Stage.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Thespian's Stage.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Sol Ring.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Mutavault.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate(Ability: becomes)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Activate(Ability: {C})
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault.Types = Land; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Thespian's Stage.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault; Ability: becomes)
Bot1.Battlefield.Sol Ring.Activate
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield = Sol Ring; Mutavault; Mutavault
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault#1.Types = Land
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault#1.Power = (absent)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault#2.Types = Land; Creature
Bot1.Battlefield.Mutavault#2.Power = 2
